Real files from the Raspberry Pi 5 8 GB test Pi (Raspberry Pi OS Lite 64-bit,
Debian 13, kernel 6.18.50+rpt-rpi-2712, booting from a 16 GB SD card), captured
by tools/pi/collect.sh on 2026-10-10. There is no get_throttled file in sysfs on
this kernel: the throttling flags come from vcgencmd. Zone files are stubs.

